        "quote": "(a) As an alternative to all other rates of fare of taxicabs, a taxicab business may offer a share-a-ride program, the elements of which include the grouping of passengers and the cost per passenger determined on a per square mile basis. The share-a-ride program shall be optional to the passenger. The maximum rates of fare for conveying persons in the share-a-ride program shall be as follows:",
